1
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,199
Brother Lian! Brother Lian, save me!

2
00:00:23,239 --> 00:00:24,160
Hostage first,

3
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:25,920
then the goods.

4
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:47,640
Brother Lian,

5
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,159
are we just letting them go like that?

6
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:20,760
Captain Li, should we keep chasing?

7
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:21,840
No need.

8
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:32,480
Deputy Director Zhou.

9
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,400
Well done, Mingyuan.

10
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:43,079
A true Whampoa Military Academy graduate.

11
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:44,400
While the mantis stalks the cicada,

12
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,319
the oriole waits behind.

13
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,359
The weapons...

14
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:48,200
...secured with such ease.

15
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,439
You flatter me, Deputy Director Zhou.

16
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:50,480
That shipment of arms

17
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,040
has arrived in full at the police warehouse.

18
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,640
Good, good.

19
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:58,159
Mingyuan, you've worked hard lately.

20
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,400
Take some time off.

21
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,159
Go home and get some good rest.

22
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,200
Thank you, Deputy Director Zhou.

23
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,280
Mr. Matsui,

24
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,400
The munitions are at the police station.

25
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:29,080
I'll deliver them to your home tomorrow.

26
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:30,840
You've done well.

27
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:36,120
Congratulations, Mr. Matsui.

28
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,159
The munitions are back with their owner.

29
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:41,840
If Sanshan Gang's Lian Ye hadn't meddled,

30
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,840
we wouldn't have had to make such a fuss.

31
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:45,000
Indeed.

32
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,439
This Lian Ye...

33
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,120
he truly deserves to die.

34
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,319
I've prepared a return gift for him.

35
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,080
Let's see

36
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:56,599
if Hu Xiaoshan can still protect him now.

37
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,560
Lian Ye...

38
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,639
Brother Lian, are you there?

39
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,560
What is this?

40
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:23,159
Brother Lian, thank you for saving me.

41
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,319
I made this peanut soup specially for you.

42
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,400
Have a taste.

43
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,560
Baozhu.

44
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,960
The Gang Leader once saved my life.

45
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:33,240
It's only right to repay his kindness.

46
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:34,759
Besides,

47
00:03:35,319 --> 00:03:37,479
I've always thought of you as a sister.

48
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:40,319
What brother wouldn't save his sister?

49
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,759
Just a sister...

50
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:55,840
What's wrong with Miss Hu?

51
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,360
Sister Dieyi asked me to give this to you.

52
00:03:58,759 --> 00:03:59,960
She found the person you're looking for.

53
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,079
I challenge you.

54
00:04:49,319 --> 00:04:50,160
You have a death wish.

55
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,720
How interesting.

56
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:12,519
Where did you learn the katana, Chinese?

57
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,639
I don't want money.

58
00:05:37,519 --> 00:05:38,920
Then what do you want?

59
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:41,920
Two years ago,

60
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:45,279
did you order Old Ding from the auto shop

61
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:47,319
to tamper with the Lian couple's car?

62
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:52,639
You're Lian Shanquan's son.

63
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,639
What a pity.

64
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,600
If only you'd been there too.

65
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,560
Talk!

66
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:01,519
Where did you hide my brother?

67
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:03,079
He's long dead.

68
00:06:03,759 --> 00:06:04,600
Gone to see the King of Hell.

69
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,680
Did you think I'd let him live?

70
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:11,639
Who ordered you to murder the Lians?

71
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,279
My employer...

72
00:06:13,879 --> 00:06:15,720
wanted to lead the Chamber of Commerce,

73
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,160
Li Zhenhai.

74
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,920
It's rare that you get a day off.

75
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:45,519
Sanfang Qixiang has a new Min restaurant.

76
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:46,720
Let's go try it tonight.

77
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,399
Li Zhenhai!

78
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:54,199
You slaughtered my whole family!

79
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:57,800
Today, I'm taking your life!

80
00:06:59,639 --> 00:07:01,000
Dad! Dad!

81
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:02,480
Dad!

82
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:07,079
Dad!

83
00:07:07,399 --> 00:07:07,959
Dad!

84
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,160
Dad!

85
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:11,759
Dad!

86
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:17,759
You must... take good care of yourself.

87
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,720
Dad! Dad!

88
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:22,480
Dad!

89
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,279
Dad!

90
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,639
Dad!

91
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:31,639
Dad!

92
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,040
Mingyuan,

93
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:53,839
I heard about your father.

94
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:55,920
My condolences.

95
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:03,759
I...

96
00:08:05,279 --> 00:08:07,319
Sanshan Gang's Lian Ye committed murder.

97
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:09,319
I'm going to arrest him.

98
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:12,279
Lian Ye has committed countless crimes.

99
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:15,120
The police won't let him go unpunished.

100
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,120
The Sanshan Gang is vast and powerful,

101
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,319
and he is a hall master.

102
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:21,519
Mingyuan, take every officer with you.

103
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,120
You must bring him to justice.

104
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,040
Yes, sir.

105
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:36,039
Police have surrounded the Sanshan Gang.

106
00:08:36,399 --> 00:08:37,840
You need to make a decision quickly.

107
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:41,679
Lian Ye killed ex-president Li Zhenhai,

108
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,679
Officer Li Mingyuan's father!

109
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:47,080
Li Mingyuan will never let him get away.

110
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:49,919
Indeed. Our Sanshan Gang upholds justice,

111
00:08:49,919 --> 00:08:50,919
helping the weak and curbing the strong,

112
00:08:50,919 --> 00:08:52,279
and never harms the innocent.

113
00:08:52,279 --> 00:08:54,679
Chief, we can't shield Lian Ye

114
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:58,200
and ruin the foundation of our gang!

115
00:08:58,759 --> 00:09:00,639
Brother Lian killed Li Zhenhai

116
00:09:00,639 --> 00:09:02,240
surely for reasons of his own!

117
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:07,679
Dad, Brother Lian risked a lot to save me.

118
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:10,120
We can't be ungrateful, Dad!

119
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:14,720
Lian Ye was far too impulsive.

120
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,759
Had he considered the Sanshan Gang at all,

121
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,200
he wouldn't have fired that shot.

122
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,720
Indeed.

123
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,879
He didn't leave any room for maneuvering.

124
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:24,840
Even if we want to protect him,

125
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,919
we have no justification!

126
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,720
I understand what you mean.

127
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,639
Lian Ye made a grave mistake,

128
00:09:29,639 --> 00:09:31,279
and I am also to blame for my oversight.

129
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,279
Yet if we were to

130
00:09:33,279 --> 00:09:35,679
cast Lian Ye out of the Sanshan Gang now,

131
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:38,840
we'd be driving him to his death.

132
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:42,799
I, Hu Xiaoshan, could never do that.

133
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,639
I'm willing to go to the police station.

134
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:03,480
Vice Chief Lin,

135
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,240
Hall Masters,

136
00:10:06,759 --> 00:10:07,840
don't make it hard on the Chief.

137
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:10,360
I, Lian Ye, will answer for my actions.

138
00:10:12,799 --> 00:10:14,120
Have you thought this through?

139
00:10:14,799 --> 00:10:16,919
Once you walk out the Sanshan Gang gates,

140
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,600
you can never come back.

141
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,200
Chief,

142
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,840
the moment I pulled the trigger,

143
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:25,159
I had already made up my mind.

144
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,720
Very well.

145
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,279
Thank you, Chief.

146
00:10:33,519 --> 00:10:34,279
Brother Lian!

147
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:02,639
Brother Lian.

148
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,919
Speak up if you've been wronged.

149
00:11:05,279 --> 00:11:06,240
We're all here.

150
00:11:12,799 --> 00:11:14,480
I brought this all on myself.

151
00:11:17,519 --> 00:11:18,320
Take care, everyone.

152
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,360
Family feuds aside,

153
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:31,240
we grew up together.

154
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,120
I've wronged you.

155
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,159
Tell that to the King of Hell.

156
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,720
I'll send you to the gallows myself.

157
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:02,240
Boss Chen! Boss Chen!

158
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:03,639
Miss Hu.

159
00:12:03,639 --> 00:12:04,440
Boss Chen.

160
00:12:05,159 --> 00:12:06,480
Brother Lian was taken by the police!

161
00:12:06,759 --> 00:12:08,360
Aren't you two childhood friends?

162
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:10,279
You know so many influential people.

163
00:12:10,279 --> 00:12:11,840
Please find a way to save him!

164
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:15,360
Calm down. Have some tea first.

165
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:16,720
This is urgent!

166
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,240
I'm in no mood for tea!

167
00:12:19,519 --> 00:12:20,840
Even your father can't save him.

168
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,519
How am I supposed to?

169
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,360
Everyone has their own fate.

170
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:25,720
You can't force these things.

171
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:26,639
You...

172
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:28,279
How can you say something so heartless?

173
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:29,679
Brother Lian was always so good to you!

174
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:31,240
How can you just leave him to die?

175
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:32,559
Don't get worked up either.

176
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,200
Lian Ye has his own way of doing things.

177
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:38,320
Even if I tried, he might not want it.

178
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:41,720
None of you are reliable when it counts!

179
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:01,480
Reporting, Colonel.

180
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,559
There are only ten real guns.

181
00:13:02,759 --> 00:13:03,759
The rest are all fakes.

182
00:13:05,399 --> 00:13:06,320
What are you talking about?

183
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,519
That's impossible.

184
00:13:15,639 --> 00:13:16,679
Impossible!

185
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,039
Lian Ye!

186
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,840
Lian Ye!

187
00:13:41,039 --> 00:13:41,519
Step down.

188
00:13:42,039 --> 00:13:42,600
Yes, sir.

189
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,480
You're finally here.

190
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,240
Deputy Director Zhou.

191
00:14:11,879 --> 00:14:15,039
Didn't think that with death at your door,

192
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,480
you'd still keep an ace up your sleeve.

193
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,320
You flatter me.

194
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:23,399
Start talking.

195
00:14:25,399 --> 00:14:27,159
Where the hell did you hide the weapons?

196
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,200
Two years ago,

197
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,039
you took over my parents' case.

198
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:50,000
Why close it and cover up for the killer?

199
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,159
Two years ago,

200
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,679
my mother contracted tuberculosis.

201
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:16,679
Her life was hanging by a thread.

202
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:20,039
Dr. Liu,

203
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,159
I'm begging you,

204
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,240
please save my mother.

205
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,840
She's my only family.

206
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,480
Officer Zhou, I wish I could.

207
00:15:26,799 --> 00:15:28,240
Your mother has tuberculosis.

208
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,639
Our hospital is small.

209
00:15:29,639 --> 00:15:30,759
We don't have antibiotics.

210
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:31,879
There's nothing I can do.

211
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,000
Dr. Liu,

212
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:34,879
please think of something.

213
00:15:34,879 --> 00:15:36,120
Dr. Liu, you—

214
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:49,519
Officer Zhou,

215
00:15:50,039 --> 00:15:51,039
I can actually get

216
00:15:51,039 --> 00:15:52,559
the antibiotics to save your mother,

217
00:15:58,879 --> 00:16:00,919
but you must do something for me.

218
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,240
"I didn't want this either."

219
00:16:10,799 --> 00:16:12,559
Your family are human,

220
00:16:14,879 --> 00:16:16,600
but mine aren't?

221
00:16:18,799 --> 00:16:21,240
When I returned to find the truth,

222
00:16:22,159 --> 00:16:24,039
I applied to the Rongcheng police.

223
00:16:24,039 --> 00:16:25,759
Unfortunately, I was rejected.

224
00:16:27,919 --> 00:16:30,120
You were the one who blocked me, right?

225
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,039
That's right.

226
00:16:33,399 --> 00:16:34,360
It was me.

227
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,240
Lian Ye,

228
00:16:39,919 --> 00:16:41,559
I was doing you a favor.

229
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:44,879
Digging into that case

230
00:16:44,879 --> 00:16:46,200
would only get you killed.

231
00:16:49,919 --> 00:16:51,159
To help me?

232
00:16:55,519 --> 00:16:56,360
Help me?

233
00:16:57,919 --> 00:16:59,120
Hypocritical nonsense!

234
00:17:02,399 --> 00:17:03,279
Fine.

235
00:17:04,759 --> 00:17:06,640
First you claimed it was for your mother,

236
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,319
and I believed you.

237
00:17:10,039 --> 00:17:11,359
But what about these past two years?

238
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:14,440
You solved countless cases big and small,

239
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,720
rising straight through the ranks,

240
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,200
from an ordinary detective

241
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:22,640
to the all-powerful Deputy Director Zhou.

242
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,440
Then tell me,

243
00:17:27,279 --> 00:17:29,599
without that powerful patron backing you...

244
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,559
In the Hainiang Temple murder,

245
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,319
it was right in this cell

246
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,640
that you murdered Wan Jun

247
00:17:44,279 --> 00:17:47,079
and framed Shen Tieshan with a fake note!

248
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,559
Please!

249
00:17:59,000 --> 00:17:59,880
Please!

250
00:18:01,519 --> 00:18:02,400
I beg you!

251
00:18:05,119 --> 00:18:05,960
Please!

252
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:08,039
Please, I didn't say a word!

253
00:18:08,559 --> 00:18:09,079
I...

254
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,799
The fisherman's murder...

255
00:18:32,559 --> 00:18:35,880
You forced Xu Jie to kill Hou Shuisheng,

256
00:18:37,599 --> 00:18:39,480
someone shot him from the dark as he fled.

257
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:41,240
That was you too, Deputy Director Zhou?

258
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,200
Deputy Director Zhou, Master found me out!

259
00:18:52,079 --> 00:18:52,960
That's right.

260
00:18:54,119 --> 00:18:55,240
It was me.

261
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,799
Hand over the weapons right now,

262
00:19:00,759 --> 00:19:02,519
and I might just spare your life.

263
00:19:03,559 --> 00:19:04,599
Otherwise...
